WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.050
Hi guys, I'm Adrian Gas and I'm a choreographer and I'm here in Blueprint Fitness.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:10.050
One word to describe BP, well that depends if it's before the workout or after the workout.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:16.050
It's epic because of all the teamwork, the way they run the class, like the energy of it.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.050
Experience at BP has been great.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:23.050
It's the first day I got here, they've just been very warming to like adding me to their groups and stuff.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.050
Everyone's always so nice and I'm getting fit, which is the most important.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.050
I'm new to the area so it's been great to meet new people.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.050
My favourite thing about BP is the constant push.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:39.050
They're always pushing you, always further to go with the exercises, with your strength, with everything really.

